    "time_estimate": "45 minutes",
    "difficulty": "Moderate",
    "introduction": "If you have a broken bookshelf that is ready for the trash then this guide is for you. Before starting your fast fix project please remember that you will need at least two people to complete your project. Through this process you will be taking a broken down bookshelf and turning it into a strong and sturdy shelf that will last a lifetime by simply replacing the back of the shelf. Please note that you will be using a jig saw during this process.",
